      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{67a97b5af2bebc2711af4843|full_name} It seems Highly illogical to add a new ui element when badges are a Perfect in-place system, Take VRChat developers for example, They have the option to Hide their employment with vrchat, Some do some don't.\n\nAs a creator to VRChat some people might not want that acknowledgement, Everyone has different choices which is what VRChat gives us, Forcing this change is stripping us of that freedom.",
